(Basic XYZ Movement Test)
(Run with caution - no boundary checks)

(--- Setup ---)
G21 (Set units to millimeters)
G90 (Set absolute distance mode)
G17 (Select XY plane)
G54 (Select coordinate system 1)

(--- Initial Positioning ---)
G0 Z10.0       (Rapid move Z axis up to a safe height of 10mm)
G0 X0.0 Y0.0   (Rapid move X and Y to origin)

(--- Test Movements ---)
F800           (Set feed rate to 800 mm/min for G1 moves)

G1 X50.0       (Move X axis to 50mm)
G1 Y50.0       (Move Y axis to 50mm)

G1 Z0.0        (Move Z axis down to 0mm)
G1 Z10.0       (Move Z axis back up to 10mm)

G1 X0.0 Y0.0   (Move X and Y simultaneously back to 0,0)

(--- Program End ---)
M2             (End program)d